*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0031
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 861
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0031.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CRD0031C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 A-DC               PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "A-DC=" A-DC
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 740 AND D-IR < 0.40
            MOVE 'A' TO A-DC
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 660
            MOVE 'R' TO A-DC
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO A-DC
    END-EVALUATE.
